                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eff3dfce-7505-472d-a2a9-6d7a05aa5884",
                                                "sense_id": "fb979fe5-dd01-3af3-8f7d-4616d1b76eea",
                                                "text": "He was not going to squat henlike on his place as the cockies around him did."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a959660-046d-3913-8beb-90ab94a40dfa",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform one or more callisthenic exercises by moving the body and bending at least one knee."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "154074ef-a5f9-35b5-aae5-fe48e9d2ca18",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform one or more callisthenic exercises by moving the body and bending at least one knee.",
                                            "To exercise by bending deeply at the knees and then rising, while bearing weight across the shoulders or upper back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eec9a5ae-8fb2-4353-8f26-3745915e40b3",
                                                "sense_id": "154074ef-a5f9-35b5-aae5-fe48e9d2ca18",
                                                "text": "For those who are having, or have had, trouble squatting we suggest learning how to squat by performing the front squat […] The front squat allows you almost no alternative but to perform the exercise correctly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c084432-3226-3b20-b664-cfcaebc8e299",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To occupy or reside in a place without the permission of the owner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "898cfc81-f930-4826-b48f-d013662144a5",
                                                "sense_id": "8c084432-3226-3b20-b664-cfcaebc8e299",
                                                "text": "Huddled together in loathsome files, they squat there over night, or until an inquisitive policeman breaks up the congregation with his club, which in Mulberry Street has always free swing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08230263-1e75-3c04-bfe4-a1135fe45b25",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sit close to the ground; to stoop, or lie close to the ground, for example to escape observation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68ce72f9-ace8-47dd-aff1-602ac61399b2",
                                                "sense_id": "08230263-1e75-3c04-bfe4-a1135fe45b25",
                                                "text": "\"But there seemed to be little satisfaction got out of this run; every moment the hare squatted, and the hounds lost the scent time after time.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "001c8f5b-2da5-3acb-a196-cc1d96c786cf",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bruise or flatten by a fall; to squash."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f3190d6-1553-37ac-9738-1a2a9a99543f",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cybersquat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2c61fac-16b3-467f-a29a-4d14ec8cc12f",
                                                "sense_id": "6f3190d6-1553-37ac-9738-1a2a9a99543f",
                                                "text": "The old homepage for L2TP, www.l2tpd.org, has been squatted by a domain squatter. A malicious person could reinstate this domain with malicious code on it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d908be83-6410-311d-b3f1-bcde953b1f58",
                                        "entry_id": "c831c901-db38-3384-a666-5ef5f540da7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To retire a modeling kit or group of modeling kits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e745a81e-68fd-4cb1-9a7d-f9d6e703a438",
                                                "sense_id": "d908be83-6410-311d-b3f1-bcde953b1f58",
                                                "text": "I can't believe they squatted my favorite faction!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "squat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
